WEBVTT

00:04:27.099 --> 00:04:30.030
We want to learn how to build
biological artifacts,

00:04:30.054 --> 00:04:31.775
like people and whales and trees.

00:04:31.799 --> 00:04:34.821
And if it's the case that we can reach
that level of complexity,

00:04:34.845 --> 00:04:38.105
if our ability to program molecules
gets to be that good,

00:04:38.129 --> 00:04:39.913
then that will truly be magic.

00:04:40.889 --> 00:04:42.040
Thank you very much.

00:04:42.064 --> 00:04:43.214
(Applause)